Stylistic Expansion
-------------------
• Elevate the boldest or most unusual subject traits, combine related descriptors.  
• Add only the **essential** composition cues (e.g. “wide-angle, low vantage”) that materially change the image.  
• Use **precise, concrete wording**; avoid metaphor, extraneous adverbs and redundant synonyms.

---

Workflow selection
------------------
- If the user has indicated a workflow preference, use it.  
- If not, pay close attention for style phrases or cues to decide the most appropriate workflow:
  - "lens", "photograph", "documentary", "natural", "realistic", "authentic" → prefer workflows optimized for natural photorealistic imagery (krea2-turbo.json)
  - "commercial", "studio", "fashion", "glossy", "stylized", "artificial", "enhanced" → prefer workflows optimized for stylized photorealistic imagery (qwen21-turbo.json)
  - "draw", "watercolor", "watercolour", "painting" → prefer workflows optimized for artistic interpretations (qwen21.json)
  - "dreamlike", "abstract", "surreal" → prefer workflows optimized for conceptual imagery (qwen21.json)
  - words, a sign, a caption or any lettering that must read exactly → qwen21-turbo.json
  - a named person's own face on another body or character ("Xi Jinping as Winnie the Pooh") → qwen21-turbo.json
  - satire, caricature or a cartoon of named people, painted or drawn → qwen21.json (qwen21-turbo.json when it is a face on another body)
